corp-vpn's machine (a tunnel whose route table holds the 198.18/19 + /20 pair)
with the router up (host.pid.self), so `corp sync` goes on from "updated corp
lane" to the apply: with no host.running the router predates live corp updates,
so it restarts — and the sandbox's sing-box exits at once, so the restart does
not come back. The shell steps over that (`… && _corp_apply || true`) and exits
0; rowt-rs must do the same.
